Greetings, envoys!
Today's hotfix includes the following changes:
 Fixed the character creation screen getting stuck on subsequent playthroughs;
 Fixed some backgrounds going rogue and appearing randomly under others during transitions;
 Fixed the space bar not working correctly || You can use the space bar to hide the UI and admire the artwork without the textbox!
 Disabled the use of the mouse scroll wheel || This will prevent players from accidentally scrolling through text. You can still skip using the Ctrl keys!
 Added a line of text to the 'Controls' codex entry || You can use Backspace to quickly access the 'More' menu;
 Added a line of text to the ending || So much more awaits players in the full game, and now it should be clearer ːsweetelfː
 Made codex entry 10 slightly easier to obtain;
Thank you all for playing and reporting these issues!
We hope you're enjoying your time in Carolise ːcharmwitchː

Greetings, envoys!
Today's hotfix includes the following changes:

 Expanded the codex entry about controls—it now includes the shortcut for skipping;
 Added a failsafe to the character creation screen that should prevent a rare softlock from occurring when skipping;
 Reworked the position of autosaves in the scenes to prevent softlocks from occurring when skipping;

Thank you all for playing! We hope you're enjoying your time in Carolise ːcharmwitchː
